OL,3,GNEWSAIs autism or ADHD diagnosis key to
OL,4,Ahelping people?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the past 25 years, there has been a
OL,7,Fhuge rise in the number of people
OL,8,Fseeking a diagnosis for autism or
OL,9,Fattention deficit hyperactivity
OL,10,Fdisorder.
OL,12,FMore than 1,255,000 people in England
OL,13,Fare currently waiting for diagnosis or
OL,14,Ftreatment for those conditions and wait
OL,15,Ftimes can be more than seven years.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
