OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAIs autism or ADHD diagnosis key to
OL,4,Ahelping people?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe NHS is now trying to steer more
OL,7,Fpeople away from a formal diagnosis and
OL,8,Ftowards targeted help, which could be
OL,9,Fgiven much more quickly, but will that
OL,10,Fbe enough for people who have spent
OL,11,Fyears questioning why life seems so
OL,12,Fdifficult?
OL,14,FFor Dawn Cameron, school years were a
OL,15,Ftough time.
